<https://w3id.org/tvbo/provenance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "W3C PROV-O aligned provenance for this entity — what it was derived from, which agent produced it, and when." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/provenance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
