<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ramp> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ramp (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ramp> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "For method=from_working_point: the parameter + domain to ramp quasi-statically (warm-start, from_previous) to reach the working point; the run then seeds from the ramp endpoint. Reuses ExplorationAxis (parameter + Range domain) — the same primitive an Exploration warm-start uses; the per-step settle comes from the experiment's integration (transient, else duration)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ramp> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ramp> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "ramp" .
