<https://w3id.org/tvbo/tail_samples> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tail_samples (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/tail_samples> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Number of samples from the end to use. Takes the last N samples before aggregation. E.g., tail_samples: 500 means use data[-500:]." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/tail_samples> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
