<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Argument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A function argument with explicit value specification. A value is either ``value`` (a literal / array / local reference) or ``used`` (a labelled array sourced from another experiment or dataset); the two are mutually exclusive. Value can be: literal (number/string), reference to input (input.key), or cross-observation reference (observation_name.output_key)." .
