<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DenseDelayGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dense adjacency with a delay-history buffer, used when any coupling carries a conduction delay and graph_representation resolves to dense. Required for interpolated (differentiable) delays (§4.1b)."@en .
