<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Intrinsic structural trait of a Dynamics model (e.g. sigmoid activation, fast-slow decomposition, E/I subpopulations). Distinct from BackendCapability: a feature is what the model has, a capability is what a backend provides."@en .
