_:genid2111 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/struct> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ParallelMode" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "How a trial / grid-point axis is realised at JAX codegen time. The choice trades peak memory against throughput: vmap batches in parallel (fast, n_trials × working-set memory), lax_map runs sequentially via ``jax.lax.map`` (memory bounded by one trial), pmap shards across devices, auto picks vmap when the estimated batched memory fits and lax_map otherwise." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode> <https://w3id.org/linkml/permissible_values> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode#auto> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode> <https://w3id.org/linkml/permissible_values> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode#lax_map> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode> <https://w3id.org/linkml/permissible_values> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode#pmap> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode> <https://w3id.org/linkml/permissible_values> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode#vmap> .
