<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ProcedureStepType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ProcedureStepType" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ProcedureStepType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The operation a ProcedureStep performs. `equation` is the general case (author-written algebra over previously-named intermediates); the others are named graph-construction operations whose options are fields rather than call syntax, so each lowers to a backend-native primitive without an expression string having to survive a parser." .
