<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/struct> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reference" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A small typed pointer to another TVBO entity (Network, Mesh, Observation, …). The ``iri`` identifies the target via the registry; the optional ``field`` is a dotted-path subkey resolved by attribute walk on the loaded target (e.g. ``field: 'weight_alpha'`` picks the ``weight_alpha`` named edge matrix on a Network; ``field: 'mesh.faces'`` picks the mesh face array). Used uniformly anywhere a TVBO entity needs to point at a sub-array of another entity without inlining the data." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reference> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Reference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
