<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Study> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Bibliographic anchor for a source publication, identified by its citation key (``citekey``).  The full bibliographic record lives in the project BibTeX library (references.bib) and is resolved by citekey; this node carries only identity, display fields and the knowledge-graph hooks (the concepts that cite it).  Specialised by SimulationStudy, which adds the experiments derived from the source." .
