<https://w3id.org/tvbo/AlgorithmCompositionMode#combined> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The included algorithm's update rules are merged into the outer loop and applied ONCE per outer iteration (1:1). Use when both algorithms update at the same cadence on the same observations. This is the default." .
