<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GraphRepresentation#auto> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Select by connection density: use the sparse representation when the adjacency is sparse enough that edge-wise evaluation is cheaper than the dense product, dense otherwise. Default. Lets the backend apply its own crossover without the recipe hard-coding a data structure." .
