<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SweepDirection#bidirectional> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/SweepDirection> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SweepDirection#bidirectional> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/struct> .
