<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/concentrationModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/concentrationModel> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Base for any model of an _ion concentration which changes with time. Internal (_concentration) and external (_extConcentration) values for the concentration of the ion are given."@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/concentrationModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml> .
