# https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connection
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connection> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Event connection directly between named components, which gets processed via a new instance of a _synapse component which is created on the target component. Normally contained inside a _projection_ element."@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml> .
