# https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connectionWD
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connectionWD> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connectionWD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connection> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connectionWD> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Event connection between named components, which gets processed via a new instance of a synapse component which is created on the target component, includes setting of _weight and _delay for the synaptic connection"@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connectionWD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml> .
