<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connectionWD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.neuroml.org/schema/neuroml2#connectionWD> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connectionWD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "delay" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/connectionWD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "weight" .
