<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/continuousProjection> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A projection between _presynapticPopulation and _postsynapticPopulation through components _preComponent at the start and _postComponent at the end of a _continuousConnection_ or _continuousConnectionInstance_. Can be used for analog synapses."@en .
