<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/fixedFactorConcentrationModelTraub> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "beta" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/fixedFactorConcentrationModelTraub> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "phi" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/fixedFactorConcentrationModelTraub> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "restingConc" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/fixedFactorConcentrationModelTraub> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/requires> "iCa" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/fixedFactorConcentrationModelTraub> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/requires> "surfaceArea" .
