<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/transientPoissonFiringSynapse> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Poisson spike generator firing at _averageRate after a _delay and for a _duration, connected to single _synapse that is triggered every time a spike is generated, providing an input current.                       Similar to ComponentType _poissonFiringSynapse_."@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/transientPoissonFiringSynapse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml> .
