<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/tsodyksMarkramDepFacMechanism> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Full Tsodyks-Markram STP model with both depression and facilitation, as in Tsodyks, Pawelzik and Markram 1998."@en .
