<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClamp> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/baseVoltageDepPointCurrent> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClamp> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Voltage clamp. Applies a variable current _i to try to keep parent at _targetVoltage. Not yet fully tested!!! Consider using voltageClampTriple!!"@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClamp> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml> .
