<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClamp> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "delay" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClamp> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "duration" .
