<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClampTriple> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/eventPort> "in" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClampTriple> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "active" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClampTriple> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "conditioningVoltage" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClampTriple> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "delay" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClampTriple> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "duration" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClampTriple> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "returnVoltage" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClampTriple> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "simpleSeriesResistance" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/voltageClampTriple> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "testingVoltage" .
