<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Deco Balanced Exc-Inh model. It extends the Reduced Wong-Wang Exc-Inh (RWW_EI) dynamic mean-field model with an effective regional gain parameter M_i that scales both the excitatory and inhibitory input currents, capturing the dynamical consequences of regional heterogeneity in the brain's transcriptional landscape (Deco et al., 2021)." .
