# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Dynamics> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The Epileptor codim 3 model is a neural mass model containing two subsystems acting at different timescales. The fast subsystem (x, y) uses the unfolding of a degenerate Takens-Bogdanov bifurcation of codimension 3; the slow subsystem (z) steers the fast one back and forth along a great arc of a sphere, producing bursting behavior. It reproduces almost all classes of bursting predicted for systems with a planar fast subsystem. The default parameters correspond to Hysteresis-Loop burster class c2s (Saddle-Node at onset, Saddle-Homoclinic at offset, branch N=1, with the stabilising modification for negative dstar)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EpileptorCodim3" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasDerivedVariable> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/E0> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasDerivedVariable> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/E1> .
