<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD/parameters/eta> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD/parameters/tau> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SD/parameters/tau_A> .
