<https://w3id.org/tvbo/InterpolatedDelays> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Delayed states read by linear interpolation between the two bracketing history time-steps instead of snapping to the nearest step, making the coupling differentiable w.r.t. the continuous delay — hence w.r.t. conduction speed (delay = tract_length / speed)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/InterpolatedDelays> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Interpolated (differentiable) delays"@en .
