<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasModelFeature> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ExcitatoryInhibitorySubpopulations> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasStochasticityCharacter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Deterministic> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/modelsAnatomicalRegion> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000956> .
