<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/modelsNeurotransmitterSystem> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0035249> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasTimescaleSeparation> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/phaseSpaceDimension> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Reduced WongWang Exc-Inh (RWW_EI) is a biologically-inspired two-dimensional (i.e., two state-variables ('S_E','S_I')) neural mass model describing the dynamics of a cortical area consisting of local networks of excitatory (AMPA) and inhibitory (GABA-A) populations of spiking neurons interconnected via NMDA synapses. These neurons are organized into an inhibitory population accounting for 20% of the neurons and an excitatory population accounting for 80% of the neurons." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/studies/Deco2014> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReducedWongWangExcInh" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Reduced Wong-Wang (E/I)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasDerivedVariable> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> .
