<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasDerivedVariable> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/derived_variables/x_i> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/parameters/G> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/parameters/I_ext> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangExcInh/parameters/I_o> .
