# https://w3id.org/tvbo/SparseCoupling
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SparseCoupling> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SparseCoupling> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/BackendCapability> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SparseCoupling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Evaluate network coupling by summing over the existing edges only (cost scales with the number of edges) rather than over the full dense adjacency (cost scales with nodes-squared). Numerically identical to the dense evaluation; a pure performance optimisation for sparsely-connected networks."@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SparseCoupling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sparse (edge-list) coupling evaluation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SparseCoupling> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/boundConstraint> "edges << nodes^2  (connection density below the backend's sparse/dense crossover)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SparseCoupling> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/enabledByGraphParameter> "graph_representation" .
