<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SpikingSimulation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Integration of point-neuron populations with threshold-reset spiking and event-delivered synapses."@en .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SpikingSimulation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Spiking (point-neuron) simulation"@en .
