<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasStateVariable> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf/state_variables/y> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SupHopf> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/model_type> "generic" .
