<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Tsodyks-Markram mean-field model of short-term synaptic plasticity. A three-variable neural mass model with firing rate E, synaptic depression variable x, and facilitation variable u. The transfer function uses a softplus nonlinearity α·log(1 + exp(s/α)). Reproduces the dynamics from BifurcationKit.jl/examples/TMModel.jl." .
