# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/I_A_var
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/I_A_var> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/I_A_var> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/I_A_var> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(I_A_var, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/I_A_var> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(I_A*(mu_se - E_A) - I_A_var)/tau_A" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/I_A_var> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Adaptation current." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/I_A_var> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "I_A_var (CakanObermayer state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/I_A_var> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "I_A_var" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_se
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_se> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_se> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_se> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(mu_se, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_se> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(J_EE*r_E + J_EI*r_I + mu_E + c_glob - I_A_var/C - mu_se)/tau_se" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_se> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Filtered mean synaptic input current to the excitatory population." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_se> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mu_se (CakanObermayer state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_se> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "mu_se" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_si
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_si> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_si> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_si> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(mu_si, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_si> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(J_IE*r_E + J_II*r_I + mu_I - mu_si)/tau_si" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_si> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Filtered mean synaptic input current to the inhibitory population." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CakanObermayer/state_variables/mu_si> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mu_si (CakanObermayer state variable)" .
