<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/parameters/v_syn> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0042391> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/parameters/v_syn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "QIF membrane reversal potential" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/parameters/v_syn> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "-10.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0042391> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "v_syn (CoombesByrne parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "QIF membrane reversal potential" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "v_syn" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/V
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/V> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(V, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/V> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "V**2 + c_glob + eta + g*(-V + v_syn) - pi**2*r**2" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "V (CoombesByrne state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "V" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/g
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/g> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(g, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/g> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "alpha*q" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "g (CoombesByrne state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "g" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/q
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/q> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/q> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/q> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(q, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/q> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "alpha*(-g + pi*k*r - 2*q)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/q> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "q (CoombesByrne state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/q> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "q" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/r
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/r> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(r, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/r> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Delta/pi + 2*V*r - g*r" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "r (CoombesByrne state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "r" .
