# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/k
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/k> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/k> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/k> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Local coupling strength" .
