# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/v_syn
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/v_syn> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0042391> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/v_syn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "QIF membrane reversal potential" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/v_syn> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "-4.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0042391> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "v_syn (CoombesByrne2D parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "QIF membrane reversal potential" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/parameters/v_syn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "v_syn" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/V
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/V> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(V, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/V> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "V**2 + c_glob + eta + pi*k*r*(-V + v_syn) - pi**2*r**2" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "V (CoombesByrne2D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "V" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/r
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/r> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(r, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/r> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Delta/pi + 2*V*r - pi*k*r**2" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "r (CoombesByrne2D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CoombesByrne2D/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "r" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060079> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "H_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "x_e/(1 - exp(-d_e*x_e))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Sigmoid function that computes the averaged firing rate of the excitatory neuron population (Deco et al., 2021)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060079> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "H_e (DecoBalancedExcInh derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "H_e" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "H_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "x_i/(1 - exp(-d_i*x_i))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Sigmoid function that computes the averaged firing rate of the inhibitory neuron population (Deco et al., 2021)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "H_i (DecoBalancedExcInh derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/H_i> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "H_i" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0098815> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "I_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "I_ext + I_o*W_e + J_N_S_e*w_p - J_i*S_i + coupling" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Input current to the excitatory population (Deco et al., 2021)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_e> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0098815> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "I_e (DecoBalancedExcInh derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "I_e" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "I_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "I_o*W_i + J_N_S_e - S_i + coupling*lamda" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_i> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Input current to the inhibitory population (Deco et al., 2021)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_i> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_i> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "I_i (DecoBalancedExcInh derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/I_i> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "I_i" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/J_N_S_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/J_N_S_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/J_N_S_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/J_N_S_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "J_N_S_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/J_N_S_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "J_N*S_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/J_N_S_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "J_N_S_e (DecoBalancedExcInh derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/J_N_S_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "J_N_S_e" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/coupling
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/coupling> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/coupling> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/coupling> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "coupling" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/coupling> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "G*J_N*(S_e*local_coupling + c_glob)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/coupling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "coupling (DecoBalancedExcInh derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/coupling> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "coupling" .
