<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/x_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "x_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DecoBalancedExcInh/derived_variables/x_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "M_i*(a_e*I_e - b_e)" .
