<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(V_i, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(I_i + V_i**2 + eta_i - pi**2*r_i**2*tau_i**2 + s_ie*tau_i - s_ii*tau_i)/tau_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_i> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "V_i (DumontGutkin state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/V_i> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "V_i" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(r_e, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(Delta_e/(pi*tau_e) + 2*V_e*r_e)/tau_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "r_e (DumontGutkin state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "r_e" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(r_i, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(Delta_i/(pi*tau_i) + 2*V_i*r_i)/tau_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_i> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "r_i (DumontGutkin state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/r_i> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "r_i" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ee
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ee> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(s_ee, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ee> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(J_ee*r_e + c_glob - s_ee)/tau_s" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "s_ee (DumontGutkin state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "s_ee" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ei
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ei> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ei> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ei> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(s_ei, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ei> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(J_ei*r_i - s_ei)/tau_s" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ei> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "s_ei (DumontGutkin state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ei> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "s_ei" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ie
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ie> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ie> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ie> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(s_ie, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ie> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(Gamma*c_glob + J_ie*r_e - s_ie)/tau_s" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ie> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "s_ie (DumontGutkin state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ie> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "s_ie" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ii
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ii> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ii> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ii> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(s_ii, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ii> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(J_ii*r_i - s_ii)/tau_s" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ii> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "s_ii (DumontGutkin state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/DumontGutkin/state_variables/s_ii> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "s_ii" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/Iext_total
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/Iext_total> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/Iext_total> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/Iext_total> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Iext_total" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/Iext_total> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Iext + local_coupling*x1" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/Iext_total> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "External input to the first population including local coupling input on x1." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/Iext_total> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Iext_total (Epileptor derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/Iext_total> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "Iext_total" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "f1" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((-a*x1**2 + b*x1, x1 < 0), (slope - x2 + 0.6*(z - 4.0)**2, True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Nonlinear function in the first state variable x1, piecewise on the sign of x1." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "f1 (Epileptor derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "f1" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f2
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "f2" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((0, x2 < -0.25), (aa*(x2 + 0.25), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Nonlinear function in the fifth state variable y2, piecewise on the value of x2." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "f2 (Epileptor derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/f2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "f2" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/h
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/h> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "h" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/h> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((x0 + 3/(1 + exp(-(x1 + 0.5)/0.1)), modification > 0), (4*(x1 - x0) + Piecewise((-0.1*z**7, z < 0), (0, True)), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/h> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Permittivity drive for z: sigmoidal when modification>0, else linear (Piecewise on modification)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "h (Epileptor derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "h" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/lfp
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/lfp> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/lfp> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/lfp> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "lfp" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/lfp> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "x2 - x1" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/derived_variables/lfp> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Local field potential proxy: TVB Epileptor observable x2 - x1." .
