# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/g
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(g, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(-0.01*(g - 0.1*x1))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Lowpass-filtered excitatory coupling variable." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "g (Epileptor state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/g> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "g" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x1, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(y1 - z + Iext_total + Kvf*c_glob0 + f1*x1)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "First state variable of the first (fast) population." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x1 (Epileptor state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x1" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x2
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x2, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(-y2 + x2 - x2**3 + Iext2 + bb*g - 0.3*(z - 3.5) + Kf*c_glob1)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "First state variable of the second (slow) population." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x2 (Epileptor state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/x2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x2" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(y1, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(c - d*x1**2 - y1)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Second state variable of the first (fast) population." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "y1 (Epileptor state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "y1" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y2
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(y2, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(-y2 + f2)/tau" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Second state variable of the second (slow) population." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "y2 (Epileptor state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/y2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "y2" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/z
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(z, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*r*(h - z + Ks*c_glob0)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/z> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Slow permittivity (energy) state variable." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "z (Epileptor state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "z" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "h" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((x0 + 3.0/(exp((-x1 - 1*0.5)/0.1) + 1.0), modification > 0), (zcond + 4*(-x0 + x1), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "h (Epileptor2D derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "h" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/x1cond
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/x1cond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "x1cond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/x1cond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((a*x1**2 + x1*(-b + d), x1 < 0), (d*x1 - slope - 0.6*(z - 4.0)**2, True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x1cond (Epileptor2D derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x1cond" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/zcond
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/zcond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "zcond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/zcond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((-0.1*z**7, z < 0), (0, True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "zcond (Epileptor2D derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "zcond" .
