<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/x0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/x0> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0043179> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/x0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Degree of excitability or epileptogenicity in Epileptor2D (Proix et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/x0> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "-1.6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/x0> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0043179> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/x0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x0 (Epileptor2D parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/x0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Degree of excitability or epileptogenicity in Epileptor2D (Proix et al.,2014).\n\nIf x0 is greater than a critical value, x0,critic = −2.05 (i.e., in the supercritical regime), the system can trigger seizures autonomously; otherwise it is in its equilibrium state (i.e., in the subcritical regime).\n\nNote:\n- If modification_E2D:\nif x0 is smaller than a critical value, x0,critic = 2.91, can trigger seizures autonomously; otherwise it is in its equilibrium state (Proix et al., 2014)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/parameters/x0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/x1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x1, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(Iext + Kvf*c_glob + c + local_coupling*x1 - x1*x1cond - z)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/x1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "First state-variable in the Epileptor2D (Proix et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x1 (Epileptor2D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x1" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/z
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(z, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "r*tt*(Ks*c_glob + h - z)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/z> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Slow permittivity state-variable of the Epileptor2D (Proix et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "z (Epileptor2D state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "z" .
# 
