<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/parameters/N> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "1.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/parameters/N> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0042391> .
