<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/parameters/tau_z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/unit> "ms" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/parameters/x_0
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/parameters/x_0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/parameters/x_0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/parameters/x_0> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "-1.6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/parameters/x_0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x_0 (Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/parameters/x_0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Excitability parameter (Epileptor convention)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/parameters/x_0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x_0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/x1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x1, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/x1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "N*(x1 - x1**3/3 - z + c_glob)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/x1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Fast excitable variable (placeholder Epileptor-like dynamics)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x1 (Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/x1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x1" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/z
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(z, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(4*(x1 - x_0) - z)/tau_z" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/z> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Slow permittivity / excitability variable." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "z (Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor3DStefanescuMcDonald/state_variables/z> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "z" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/h
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/h> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "h" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/h> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((x0 + 3/(exp((-x1 - 1*0.5)/0.1) + 1), modification > 0), (zcond + 4*(-x0 + x1), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "h (Epileptor5D derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/h> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "h" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/x1cond
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/x1cond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "x1cond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/x1cond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise(((-a)*x1**2 + b*x1, x1 < 0), (slope - x2 + 0.6*(z - 4.0)**2, True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x1cond (Epileptor5D derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x1cond" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/y2cond
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/y2cond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/y2cond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/y2cond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "y2cond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/y2cond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((0.0, x2 < -0.25), (aa*(x2 + 0.25), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/y2cond> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "y2cond (Epileptor5D derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/y2cond> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "y2cond" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/zcond
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/zcond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "zcond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/zcond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((-0.1*z**7, z < 0), (0.0, True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "zcond (Epileptor5D derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/derived_variables/zcond> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "zcond" .
