<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/d> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "5.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "d (Epileptor5D parameter)" .
