<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/modification> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "When modification is True, the function h_E5D uses a nonlinear influence on z_E5D" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/modification> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/modification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "modification (Epileptor5D parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/modification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "When modification is True, the function h_E5D uses a nonlinear influence on z_E5D. The default value is False, i.e., linear influence on z_E5D." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/modification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "modification" .
