<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/tau> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tau (Epileptor5D parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/tau> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Temporal scaling coefficient in fifth state variable" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/tau> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "tau" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/tt
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/tt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/tt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D/parameters/tt> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Characteristic time scale of the whole-system Epileptor5D" .
