# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F0
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F0> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "F0" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F0> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(mu1_start*(mu1_start*mu2_stop - mu1_stop*mu2_start) + nu_start*(-mu2_start*nu_stop + mu2_stop*nu_start))/sqrt((mu1_start*(mu1_start*mu2_stop - mu1_stop*mu2_start) + nu_start*(-mu2_start*nu_stop + mu2_stop*nu_start))**2 + (-mu1_start*(-mu1_start*nu_stop + mu1_stop*nu_start) - mu2_start*(-mu2_start*nu_stop + mu2_stop*nu_start))**2 + (mu2_start*(mu1_start*mu2_stop - mu1_stop*mu2_start) - nu_start*(-mu1_start*nu_stop + mu1_stop*nu_start))**2)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "First component of the unit vector F parametrising the great arc (normalised ((A x B) x A) with B = [mu2_stop, -mu1_stop, nu_stop])." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "F0 (EpileptorCodim3 derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "F0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "F1" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(mu2_start*(mu1_start*mu2_stop - mu1_stop*mu2_start) - nu_start*(-mu1_start*nu_stop + mu1_stop*nu_start))/sqrt((mu1_start*(mu1_start*mu2_stop - mu1_stop*mu2_start) + nu_start*(-mu2_start*nu_stop + mu2_stop*nu_start))**2 + (-mu1_start*(-mu1_start*nu_stop + mu1_stop*nu_start) - mu2_start*(-mu2_start*nu_stop + mu2_stop*nu_start))**2 + (mu2_start*(mu1_start*mu2_stop - mu1_stop*mu2_start) - nu_start*(-mu1_start*nu_stop + mu1_stop*nu_start))**2)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Second component of the unit vector F parametrising the great arc." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "F1 (EpileptorCodim3 derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "F1" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F2
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "F2" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(-mu1_start*(-mu1_start*nu_stop + mu1_stop*nu_start) - mu2_start*(-mu2_start*nu_stop + mu2_stop*nu_start))/sqrt((mu1_start*(mu1_start*mu2_stop - mu1_stop*mu2_start) + nu_start*(-mu2_start*nu_stop + mu2_stop*nu_start))**2 + (-mu1_start*(-mu1_start*nu_stop + mu1_stop*nu_start) - mu2_start*(-mu2_start*nu_stop + mu2_stop*nu_start))**2 + (mu2_start*(mu1_start*mu2_stop - mu1_stop*mu2_start) - nu_start*(-mu1_start*nu_stop + mu1_stop*nu_start))**2)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Third component of the unit vector F parametrising the great arc." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "F2 (EpileptorCodim3 derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/F2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "F2" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_a
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
