<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Half of mu1 (the Cardano coefficient mu1/2 for the depressed cubic xs**3 - mu2*xs - mu1 = 0)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cardano_a (EpileptorCodim3 derived variable)" .
