# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_d
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_d> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "cardano_d" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_d> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "mu1**2/4 - mu2**3/27" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Cardano discriminant mu1**2/4 - mu2**3/27 for the cubic xs**3 - mu2*xs - mu1 = 0." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cardano_d (EpileptorCodim3 derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/cardano_d> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "cardano_d" .
