<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/mu1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "-R*(E1*cos(z) + F1*sin(z))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/mu1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bifurcation parameter mu1 along the great arc as a function of the slow variable z." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/mu1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mu1 (EpileptorCodim3 derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/derived_variables/mu1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "mu1" .
