<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/parameters/Ks> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/parameters/Ks> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3/parameters/Ks> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Slow permittivity coupling strength, the default of zero is no coupling." .
