# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/derived_variables/xs
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/derived_variables/xs> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/derived_variables/xs> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/derived_variables/xs> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "xs" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/derived_variables/xs> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((Abs(mu1/2 + sqdisc)**(1/3)*cos(atan2(0, mu1/2 + sqdisc)/3) + Abs(mu1/2 - sqdisc)**(1/3)*cos(atan2(0, mu1/2 - sqdisc)/3), disc >= 0), (sqrt((mu1/2)**2 + sqdisc**2)**(1/3)*cos(atan2(sqdisc, mu1/2)/3) + sqrt((mu1/2)**2 + sqdisc**2)**(1/3)*cos(atan2(-sqdisc, mu1/2)/3), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/derived_variables/xs> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Real x-coordinate of the resting state, the branch (N = 1) real solution of x_s^3 - mu2 x_s - mu1 = 0 via Cardano's formula, taking the real part of the principal complex cube roots in both the one-real-root (disc >= 0) and three-real-roots (disc < 0) regimes." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/derived_variables/xs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "xs (EpileptorCodim3SlowMod derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/derived_variables/xs> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "xs" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/parameters/Ks
