<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/parameters/Ks> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/parameters/Ks> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Slow permittivity coupling strength, the default is no coupling." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/parameters/Ks> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/parameters/Ks> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ks (EpileptorCodim3SlowMod parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorCodim3SlowMod/parameters/Ks> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "Ks" .
