# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/lc_1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/lc_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
