# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/output
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/output> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/output> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/output> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "output" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/output> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "p*(-x1 + x2) + x_rs*(1 - p)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/output> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "output (EpileptorRestingState derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/output> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "output" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/x1cond
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/x1cond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "x1cond" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/x1cond> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise(((-a)*x1**2 + b*x1, x1 < 0), (slope - x2 + 0.6*(z - 4.0)**2, True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/derived_variables/x1cond> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x1cond (EpileptorRestingState derived variable)" .
