<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/state_variables/x2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tt*(Iext2 + Kf*c_glob1 + bb*g - x2**3 + x2 - y2 - 0.3*z + 1.05)" .
