<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/state_variables/x_rs> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "d_rs*tau_rs*(I_rs*gamma_rs + K_rs*c_glob2*gamma_rs + alpha_rs*y_rs + e_rs*x_rs**2 - f_rs*x_rs**3 + lc_1)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/state_variables/x_rs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x_rs (EpileptorRestingState state variable)" .
