<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/state_variables/y_rs> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "d_rs*(a_rs + b_rs*x_rs - beta_rs*y_rs)/tau_rs" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/state_variables/y_rs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "y_rs (EpileptorRestingState state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/EpileptorRestingState/state_variables/y_rs> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "y_rs" .
