<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/parameters/tau_A> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Adaptation time scale" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/parameters/tau_A> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "10.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/parameters/tau_A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tau_A (GastSchmidtKnosche_SF parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/parameters/tau_A> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Adaptation time scale" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/parameters/tau_A> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "tau_A" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/A
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/A> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/A> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/A> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(A, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/A> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "B/tau_A" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A (GastSchmidtKnosche_SF state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/A> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "A" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/B
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/B> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/B> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/B> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(B, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/B> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(-A - 2*B + alpha*r)/tau_A" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/B> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "B (GastSchmidtKnosche_SF state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/B> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "B" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/V
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/V> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(V, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/V> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(-A + I + J*r*tau + V**2 + c_glob0*cr + c_glob1*cv + eta - pi**2*r**2*tau**2)/tau" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "V (GastSchmidtKnosche_SF state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/V> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "V" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/r
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/r> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(r, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/r> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(Delta/(pi*tau) + 2*V*r)/tau" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "r (GastSchmidtKnosche_SF state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GastSchmidtKnosche_SF/state_variables/r> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "r" .
