# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Reciprocal of the time constant of passive membrane and all other spatially distributed delays in the dendritic network. Also called average synaptic time constant." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "a (JansenRit parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Rate constant of the excitatory post-synaptic potential (EPSP). It is interpreted as being the lumped representation of the sum of the reciprocal of the time constant of passive membrane and all other spatially distributed delays, including temporal dispersion in the afferent tract, synaptic diffusion, and resistive-capacitive delay in the dendritic network." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "a" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/unit> "per_ms" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099536> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Average probability constant of the number of synapses made by the pyramidal cells to the dendrites of the excitatory interneurons  (feedback excitatory loop)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_1> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "1.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_1> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099536> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "a_1 (JansenRit parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Average probability constant of the number of synapses made by the pyramidal cells to the dendrites of the excitatory interneurons  (feedback excitatory loop). It characterizes the connectivity between the PCs and EINs." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "a_1" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_2
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_2> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099536> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Average probability constant of the number of synapses made by the EINs to the dendrites of the PCs" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_2> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_2> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099536> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "a_2 (JansenRit parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Average probability constant of the number of synapses made by the EINs to the dendrites of the PCs. It characterizes the excitatory connectivity between the EINs and PCs." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "a_2" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_3
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_3> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099536> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Average probability constant of the number of synapses made by the PCs to the dendrites of the IINs" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_3> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.25"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_3> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099536> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "a_3 (JansenRit parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Average probability constant of the number of synapses made by the PCs to the dendrites of the IINs. It characterizes the connectivity between the PCs and inhibitory IINs." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "a_3" .
