<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_4> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099536> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Average probability constant of the number of synapses made by the IINs to the dendrites of the PCs" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_4> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.25"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_4> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060077> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_4> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099536> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "a_4 (JansenRit parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Average probability constant of the number of synapses made by the IINs to the dendrites of the PCs. It characterizes the connectivity between the IINs and  PCs." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/a_4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "a_4" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Rate constant of the inhibitory post-synaptic potential (IPSP)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.05"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "b (JansenRit parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Rate constant of the inhibitory post-synaptic potential (IPSP). It is interpreted as being the lumped representation of the sum of the reciprocal of the time constant of passive membrane and all other spatially distributed delays, including temporal dispersion in the afferent tract, synaptic diffusion, and resistive-capacitive delay in the dendritic network (Freeman 1975)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "b" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/b> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/unit> "per_ms" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060079> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Mean excitatory external input to the derivative of the state-variable y4_JR (PCs) represented by a pulse density, that consists of activity originating from adjacent and more distant cortical columns, as well as from subcortical structures (e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.22"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060079> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mu (JansenRit parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mean excitatory external input to the derivative of the state-variable y4_JR (PCs) represented by a pulse density, that consists of activity originating from adjacent and more distant cortical columns, as well as from subcortical structures (e.g., thalamus)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "mu" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/mu> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/unit> "per_ms" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Asymptotic of the sigmoid function Sigm_JR corresponds to the maximum firing rate of the neural populations" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.0025"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "nu_max (JansenRit parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Asymptotic of the sigmoid function Sigm_JR corresponds to the maximum firing rate of the neural populations." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "nu_max" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/nu_max> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/unit> "per_ms" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/r
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/r> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
