<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/r> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Steepness (or gain) parameter of the sigmoid function Sigm_JR." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit/parameters/r> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "r" .
