<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(Z, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "b*t_scale*(I_ext*a_ni + Q_V*V*a_ei)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Third state-variable of the Larter-Breakspear (Breakspear et al" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LarterBreakspear/state_variables/Z> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000099> .
