<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/alpha> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tau*(alpha - f_i*alpha**3/3 - beta) + K21*(mode_dot(xi, Cik) - alpha) + tau*(II_i + mode_sum(c_glob0) + local_coupling*xi)" .
