# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/beta
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/beta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/beta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/beta> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(beta, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/beta> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(alpha - b*beta + n_i)/tau" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/beta> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "beta (ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/beta> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "beta" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/eta
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/eta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/eta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/eta> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(eta, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/eta> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(xi - b*eta + m_i)/tau" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/eta> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "eta (ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/eta> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "eta" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/xi
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/xi> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/xi> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/xi> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(xi, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/xi> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tau*(xi - e_i*xi**3/3 - eta) + K11*(mode_dot(xi, Aik) - xi) - K12*(mode_dot(alpha, Bik) - xi) + tau*(IE_i + mode_sum(c_glob0) + local_coupling*xi)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/xi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "xi (ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedSetFitzHughNagumo/state_variables/xi> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "xi" .
