# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099605> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "H" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(a*x - b)/(1 - exp(-d*(a*x - b)))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWang/derived_variables/H> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Sigmoid input-output function of the synaptic input current, x_RWW, that computes the averaged firing rate of the neurons population (Deco et al., 2013)." .
