<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/tau_s> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "NMDA decay time constant" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/tau_s> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "100.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/tau_s> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tau_s (ReducedWongWangTvboptim parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/tau_s> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "NMDA decay time constant for the synaptic gating variable S." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/tau_s> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "tau_s" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/tau_s> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/unit> "ms" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/w
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/w> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/w> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/w> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Excitatory recurrence strength (local feedback)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/w> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/w> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "w (ReducedWongWangTvboptim parameter)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/w> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Local excitatory recurrence strength. Controls the positive feedback within each cortical population. Higher values increase local excitation and push the system toward higher firing rates." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/w> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "w" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/parameters/w> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/unit> "dimensionless" .
