<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/state_variables/S> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/state_variables/S> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(S, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/state_variables/S> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "-S/tau_s + (1 - S)*H(x)*gamma" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReducedWongWangTvboptim/state_variables/S> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Average NMDA synaptic gating variable, representing the fraction of open NMDA channels at each network node." .
