<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(alpha, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/StefanescuJirsa2D/state_variables/alpha> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "tau*(alpha - f_i*alpha**3/3 - beta) + K21*(Cik*xi - alpha) + tau*(II_i + c_glob + local_coupling*xi)" .
