<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E (TsodyksMarkram state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "E" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
