<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(U0 - u)/tauF + U0*(1 - u)*E" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Synaptic facilitation variable (release probability). Decays to U0 with time constant tauF and is enhanced proportionally to firing." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "u (TsodyksMarkram state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/u> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "u" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(x, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(1 - x)/tauD - u*x*E" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Synaptic depression variable (fraction of available neurotransmitter). Recovers to 1 with time constant tauD and is depleted proportionally to firing." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x (TsodyksMarkram state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TsodyksMarkram/state_variables/x> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "x" .
