<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "c_e/(1.0 + exp(-a_e*(-b_e + x_e))) - 1.0*shift_sigmoid/(exp(a_e*b_e) + 1.0)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "s_e (WilsonCowan derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/s_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "s_e" .
