<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "alpha_e*(-I*c_ei + P + c_ee*E + c_glob + lc_0 + lc_1 - theta_e)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Average level of excitation in excitatory neuron at time t. Can be interpreted as membrane potential (Sanz-Leon et al., 2015)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/WilsonCowan/derived_variables/x_e> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0042391> .
