# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/E
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/E> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(E, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/E> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(-E + f_out_e)/T" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/E> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Firing rate of excitatory population in KHz" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E (ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder state variable)" .
