# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/I
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/I> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/I> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/I> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(I, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/I> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(-I + f_out_i)/T" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/I> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Firing rate of inhibitory population in KHz" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/I> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "I (ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/I> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "I" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(W_e, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "E*b_e - W_e/tau_w_e + a_e*(-E_L_e + mu_V_e)/tau_w_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Level of adaptation of excitatory in pA" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "W_e (ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "W_e" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(W_i, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "I*b_i - W_i/tau_w_i + a_i*(-E_L_i + mu_V_i)/tau_w_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_i> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Level of adaptation of inhibitory in pA" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_i> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "W_i (ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/W_i> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "W_i" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/ou_drift
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(ou_drift, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "-ou_drift/tau_OU" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ou_drift (ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationFirstOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "ou_drift" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/derived_variables/E_input_excitatory
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/derived_variables/E_input_excitatory> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/derived_variables/E_input_excitatory> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/derived_variables/E_input_excitatory> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "E_input_excitatory" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/derived_variables/E_input_excitatory> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((0.0, c_glob + local_coupling*E + external_input_ex_ex + weight_noise*ou_drift < 0), (c_glob + local_coupling*E + external_input_ex_ex + weight_noise*ou_drift, True))" .
