<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/parameters/weight_noise> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Weight of the Ornstein-Uhlenbeck noise drift onto the external excitatory input." .
