# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ee
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ee> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(C_ee, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ee> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(TFe*(1.0/T - TFe)/(N_tot*(1.0 - g)) + (TFe - E)**2 + 2.0*C_ee*dfe_TFe + 2.0*C_ei*dfi_TFe - 2.0*C_ee)/T" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Variance of the excitatory population activity." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C_ee (ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "C_ee" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ei
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ei> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ei> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ei> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(C_ei, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ei> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "((TFe - E)*(TFi - I) + C_ee*dfe_TFe + C_ei*dfe_TFi + C_ei*dfi_TFe + C_ii*dfi_TFi - 2.0*C_ei)/T" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ei> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Covariance between the excitatory and inhibitory population activities." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ei> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C_ei (ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ei> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "C_ei" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ii
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ii> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ii> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ii> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(C_ii, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ii> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(TFi*(1.0/T - TFi)/(N_tot*g) + (TFi - I)**2 + 2.0*C_ii*dfi_TFi + 2.0*C_ei*dfe_TFi - 2.0*C_ii)/T" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ii> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Variance of the inhibitory population activity." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ii> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C_ii (ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/C_ii> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "C_ii" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/E
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/E> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(E, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/E> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(TFe - E + 0.5*C_ee*d2_fefe_e + 0.5*C_ei*d2_fefi_e + 0.5*C_ei*d2_fife_e + 0.5*C_ii*d2_fifi_e)/T" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/E> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Firing rate of the excitatory population [kHz]." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E (ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/E> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "E" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/I
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/I> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/I> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/I> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(I, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/I> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(TFi - I + 0.5*C_ee*d2_fefe_i + 0.5*C_ei*d2_fefi_i + 0.5*C_ei*d2_fife_i + 0.5*C_ii*d2_fifi_i)/T" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/I> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Firing rate of the inhibitory population [kHz]." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/I> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "I (ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/I> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "I" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_e
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(W_e, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_e> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "-W_e/tau_w_e + b_e*E + a_e*(muV_e - E_L_e)/tau_w_e" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Adaptation current of the excitatory population [pA]." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "W_e (ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_e> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "W_e" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_i
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_i> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(W_i, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_i> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "-W_i/tau_w_i + b_i*I + a_i*(muV_i - E_L_i)/tau_w_i" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_i> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Adaptation current of the inhibitory population [pA]." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_i> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "W_i (ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/W_i> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "W_i" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/ou_drift
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(ou_drift, t)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "-ou_drift/tau_OU" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Ornstein-Uhlenbeck noise drift." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ou_drift (ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder state variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZerlautAdaptationSecondOrder/state_variables/ou_drift> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "ou_drift" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/coupled_input
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/coupled_input> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/coupled_input> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/coupled_input> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "coupled_input" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/coupled_input> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "2*e0/(exp(rho_1*(-c_glob - local_coupling*v6 + rho_2)) + 1)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/coupled_input> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "coupled_input (ZetterbergJansen derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/coupled_input> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "coupled_input" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v1
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "sigma_v1" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v1> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((0, rho_1*(rho_2 - v1) > 709), (2*e0/(exp(rho_1*(rho_2 - v1)) + 1), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sigma_v1 (ZetterbergJansen derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "sigma_v1" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v23
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v23> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v23> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/DerivedVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v23> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "sigma_v23" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v23> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((0, rho_1*(rho_2 - (v2 - v3)) > 709), (2*e0/(exp(rho_1*(rho_2 - (v2 - v3))) + 1), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v23> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sigma_v23 (ZetterbergJansen derived variable)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v23> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "sigma_v23" .
