<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v45> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "sigma_v45" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v45> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "Piecewise((0, rho_1*(rho_2 - (v4 - v5)) > 709), (2*e0/(exp(rho_1*(rho_2 - (v4 - v5))) + 1), True))" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/derived_variables/sigma_v45> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sigma_v45 (ZetterbergJansen derived variable)" .
