<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/parameters/ke> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Reciprocal of the time constant of passive membrane and all         other spatially distributed delays in the dendritic network [ms^-1]" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/parameters/ke> <http://schema.org/defaultValue> "0.1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
