<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/parameters/ke> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Reciprocal of the time constant of passive membrane and all\n        other spatially distributed delays in the dendritic network [ms^-1].\n        Also called average synaptic time constant." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ZetterbergJansen/parameters/ke> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "ke" .
