# https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/Delay_Speed_Synchronization
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/Delay_Speed_Synchronization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/Delay_Speed_Synchronization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/SimulationExperiment> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/Delay_Speed_Synchronization> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Coupled Kuramoto phase oscillators on the Desikan-Killiany connectome. A sweep over the conduction speed varies the transmission delays (delays = tract length / speed) and measures the Kuramoto order parameter, reproducing the non-monotonic delay-organised synchronization of Petkoski & Jirsa (2019).\n" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/experiments/Delay_Speed_Synchronization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Delays Shape Synchronization" .
