<https://w3id.org/tvbo/graph_generators/WattsStrogatz> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Watts-Strogatz small-world graph. Starts as a regular ring lattice where each node connects to k nearest neighbours, then rewires each edge with probability p to a uniformly random target." .
