<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "BOLD fMRI observation model using a Double Exponential hemodynamic response function." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BOLD_DoubleExponential" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/observation_models/bold_double_exponential/parameters/TR> .
