<https://w3id.org/tvbo/average> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Averaging mode across trials. 'trials' = average over n_trials independent runs (evoked potential paradigm). None = return all trials." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/average> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/average> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "average" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/backend> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "backend (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/backend> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Execution backend this experiment runs on when no backend is passed explicitly (e.g. 'tvboptim', 'tvb', 'jax', 'julia', 'brian2'). Declares the engine the experiment requires — a spiking point-neuron network sets 'brian2', a mean-field model leaves it unset. run(format=...) and ``tvbo run --backend`` override it; when unset the default backend (tvboptim) is used." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/backend> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/backend> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "backend" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/bids_dir> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "bids_dir (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/bids_dir> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Path to BEP017-compliant BIDS directory for loading connectivity matrices" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/bids_dir> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/bids_dir> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "bids_dir" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/category> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "category (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/category> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Coarse classification of the phenotype bundle, used for filtering in larger study libraries. Canonical values: ``cognitive`` (intelligence / memory / attention scores), ``clinical`` (UPDRS, MMSE, …), ``behavioral`` (raw task outputs), ``demographic``, ``physiological``, ``derived`` (composite scores like g-factor or brain-age). Free string — extend as needed." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/category> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/category> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "category" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/citekey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "citekey (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/citekey> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "BibTeX citation key; the join key into references.bib for full bibliographic detail. A study is identified by its key/citekey and described by its title — no ``name`` needed." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/citekey> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/citekey> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "citekey" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/code_modules> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "code_modules (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/code_modules> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Importable module names whose import registers this figure's custom panels / transforms (via bsplot.register_panel / register_transform). The emitted plot.py imports them, so a study ships its bespoke figure code in its code_source instead of in core tvbo. The modules must be importable when the figure renders (loading the study puts its code/ dir on the path)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/code_modules> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/code_modules> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "code_modules" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/colormap> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "colormap (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/colormap> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Named colormap (routed through the cmap resolver)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/colormap> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/colormap> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "colormap" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/comment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "comment (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/comment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Free-text provenance tag on each submitted job (Slurm ``--comment``), visible in ``squeue -o %k``. Unset means an auto-generated ``tvbo:<study>/exp_<experiment>`` tag so a queued job maps back to its experiment; set it to override with a custom string." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/comment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/comment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "comment" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/concept_iri> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "concept_iri (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/concept_iri> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Cognitive Atlas IRI of the cognitive construct measured (e.g. ``cogat:trm_521ef89ce5e84`` for fluid intelligence)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/concept_iri> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/concept_iri> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "concept_iri" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_parameters> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "condition_parameters (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_parameters> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Parameter symbols accessible in the condition function." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_parameters> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_parameters> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "condition_parameters" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_states> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "condition_states (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "State variable symbols accessible in the condition function. For edges, can include source/destination vertex outputs." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/condition_states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "condition_states" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/connectivity_ref> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "connectivity_ref (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/connectivity_ref> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Reference to connectivity data (_conndata-network_connectivity.tsv)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/connectivity_ref> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/connectivity_ref> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "connectivity_ref" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "container (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Container image wrapping each task; tasks run as ``<runtime> exec <image> …``. A concrete image passes through as given — either a registry reference the engine resolves and materialises itself (``docker://…:tag``) or a path to an image file already built on the target, which pins the exact image and needs no pull. A reference that leaves the version open is resolved to the tvbo image matching the running CLI: the symbolic value ``tvbo``, or a tvbo registry reference with no ``:tag``. Left unset while ``requirements`` are declared, the base still defaults to that tvbo image (the deps layer onto it); unset with no requirements, tasks run bare." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "container" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container_args> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "container_args (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container_args> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Additional arguments passed verbatim to the container runtime when it executes a task. The extension point for runtime flags the typed fields do not cover, mirroring ``WorkflowEngineConfig.options`` for scheduler directives." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container_args> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container_args> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "container_args" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container_binds> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "container_binds (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container_binds> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Host paths that must be visible inside the container beyond the ones its runtime binds by default (typically ``$HOME`` and the working directory). Required whenever a task reads or writes a site filesystem outside those defaults — a shared cache, a data tree, or a scratch area a symlink resolves into. Rendered into each runtime's own flag (``--bind`` for Apptainer/Singularity)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container_binds> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/container_binds> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "container_binds" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/curvature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "curvature (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/curvature> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Optional path to per-vertex curvature (N,) float. Default convention: ``mesh/curvature``." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/curvature> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/curvature> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "curvature" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/dataset_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dataset_id (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/dataset_id> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Unique identifier for this phenotype bundle." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/dataset_id> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/dataset_id> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "dataset_id" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "datatype (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Declared value type of this parameter, given as a schema range name — a primitive (``integer``, ``float``, ``string``, ``uriorcurie``) or a class (e.g. ``Distribution``). Documents the expected type when the parameter is a *declaration* carrying no concrete ``value`` (e.g. a GraphGenerator's typed argument interface). Distinct from ``domain`` (numeric bounds) and ``unit``." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "datatype" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/date_created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "date_created (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/date_created> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "ISO 8601 (prov:generatedAtTime)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/date_created> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/date_created> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "date_created" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/default> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "default (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/default> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/default> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "default" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/definition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "definition (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/definition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/definition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "definition" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/derived_from> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "derived_from (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/derived_from> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/derived_from> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "derived_from" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/desc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "desc (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/desc> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "BIDS desc- entity (e.g., FCavg, SC), for disambiguating derived data variants" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/desc> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/desc> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "desc" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/description> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "description (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/description> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/description> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "description" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/descriptor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "descriptor (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/descriptor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Short alphanumeric identifier for the BIDS desc- filename entity (e.g., SC, FC, EC, SCFC). Classifies the connectivity modality of the network's edge measures." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/descriptor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/descriptor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "descriptor" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/detail> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "detail (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/detail> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Non-visual grouping dim (e.g. the hue/iterate dim)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/detail> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/detail> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "detail" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/dimension_labels> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dimension_labels (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/dimension_labels> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ordered labels for the matrix columns (dim-1) when the matrix is non-square.  Row labels (dim-0) are the parent Network's node labels.  Stored as HDF5 dimension scales in the companion file." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/dimension_labels> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/dimension_labels> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "dimension_labels" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/direction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "direction (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/direction> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Exceedance direction: ``greater_equal`` (fraction of permutations whose statistic ≥ the observed) or ``less_equal`` (one-sided negative test)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/direction> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/direction> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "direction" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/doi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "doi (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/doi> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/doi> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "doi" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/elements> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "elements (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/elements> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Topology indices: either a file reference, or (when inlined on a Network) a dotted path inside the parent Network's h5 companion to the (M, 3) int triangle face array. Default convention: ``mesh/faces``." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/elements> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/elements> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "elements" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/equation_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "equation_type (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/equation_type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "How to interpret ``equation.rhs`` when advancing this state: 'differential' (default) integrates it as ``dx/dt = rhs``; 'algebraic' is a constraint ``0 = rhs`` / ``x ~ rhs`` (DAE); 'recurrence' is a discrete per-step update ``x_next = rhs`` (no integrator applied), used by an observation's auxiliary ``dynamics`` for online reductions/accumulators (e.g. a running sum ``x_next = x + f``) — the symbolic, backend-independent sibling of the continuous 'differential' form. Algebraic equations are used by ModelingToolkit.jl backend." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/equation_type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/equation_type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "equation_type" .
# 
