<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ref> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ref> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "ref" .
