# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/subjects> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "subjects (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/subjects> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ordered list of subject IDs (e.g. HCP-YA 6-digit IDs). Each ``measures/<name>`` array in the h5 companion is indexed by this order." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/subjects> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/subjects> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "subjects" .
# 
