<https://w3id.org/tvbo/suffix> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "BIDS suffix (e.g., relmat), the trailing name component before the extension" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/suffix> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/suffix> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "suffix" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/symbol> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "symbol (slot)" .
