# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/symmetry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "symmetry (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/symmetry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Edge symmetry type for NetworkDynamics.jl EdgeModel: 'directed' (default), 'antisymmetric', or 'symmetric'. AntiSymmetric edges flip sign for the reverse direction." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/symmetry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/symmetry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "symmetry" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_component> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "target_component (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_component> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Component to attach this event to. Can be a node label, edge label, or 'all_edges'/'all_vertices' for broadcast. If not specified, event is experiment-level." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_component> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_component> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "target_component" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_network> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "target_network (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_network> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Path or name of the Network whose nodes define the target endpoints (e.g. the columns of a non-square projection matrix such as a gain matrix region → EEG sensors). Also accepts the relative-path sentinel `parent` / `parent/parent` for cross-scale signal flow up the Node.subnetwork hierarchy. One mechanism handles both projection matrices (absolute IRI) and multi-scale boundaries (sentinel)." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_network> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_network> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "target_network" .
# 
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_regions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "target_regions (slot)" .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_regions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Regions a stimulus-type event targets: 'all' (broadcast to every node) or explicit region labels / indices. More expressive than the integer-only `regions` slot; when both are absent the event applies to all regions." .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_regions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/target_regions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "target_regions" .
# 
